    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if you found an abandoned sludge girl in a cardboard box? Take her home, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doku-chan is a sentient pile of sludge that used to stay hidden in alleyways until she met OL-san, an overworked office lady. But will things work out between them, or could this love be lethal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus starts the most poisonous but fluffy yuri romance story you'll ever buy and play to completion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 50,000+ word mostly linear visual novel.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluffy anime fanfiction tropes galore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A literally toxic romance story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue options that can unlock new story scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial English voice acting for special scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, minigames!</p></li></ul>",
